
# Release archives live as GitHub RELEASE ASSETS, never in this repository.
# Pages serves only appcast.xml, index.html and the .md release notes. Committing 64 MB
# DMGs added ~800 MB of history that nothing ever downloaded from here.
# They must still EXIST in this folder — generate_appcast reads them to sign and to
# compute deltas — they simply must not be tracked.
*.dmg
*.delta
*.zip
